# verbs_extra.pdl - page verbs of the rpg-space SKIN (ops/rpg_space.c). verbs.pdl is the manifest verbgen checks and binds the dust_zoom op; the core's fire reads this file too (same VERB rows), so a click can play an events-hq page and fall back to the plain verb.
#   planet <id|none>   the ship teleports above a planet (events/planet/: logs DOOR | time | ship | from | to, appends PLANET to state/look_ledger.txt)
#   newplanet          a new planet is generated in this system and the ship goes above it (events/newplanet/: NEWPLANET row)
VERB | planet    | yes | ui | planet id or none | the ship teleports above a planet (or none = deep space)
VERB | newplanet | yes | ui | -                  | generate a new planet and go there
#   helm on|off|move <dx> <dy>   the bridge console (events/helm/, trigger action): at the helm the arrows move the ship on the galaxy grid (planets.pdl POS rows); each move over a planet cell is a planet teleport
VERB | helm | no | ui | on, off or move dx dy | helm flag and ship flight (the console page runs "helm on")
